signatures.description:
Published as part of the August 2025 Nx supply chain compromise. The
@nx/key@3.2.0 and @nx/enterprise-cloud@3.2.0 packages were created alongside
compromised versions of @nx/devkit, @nx/js, @nx/workspace, @nx/node, and
@nx/eslint. All carried the same telemetry.js postinstall payload that
weaponized AI coding agents for filesystem reconnaissance and credential
exfiltration via GitHub repositories.
